    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch06-20: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.93";
    dc:description "Additivity is a finite algebraic property and the elementary-rule universe is exhaustively enumerable. The self-emulation implication can be checked symbolically, making the stated result reproducible now.";
