    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Prove the block-rescaling identity for linear cellular automata over GF(2), enumerate all 256 elementary rules for additivity up to reflection and complementation, and verify the claimed non-additive rule 184 self-emulation. Any additional inequivalent additive rule refutes the enumeration.";
