    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "The precise self-emulation scale must be specified.", "“Fundamentally different” requires explicit symmetry equivalences.";
